      "id": "claim_6ad75283e7214da5809d55ca3433a584",
      "statement": "The FastAPI lifespan requires PostgreSQL, runs migrations before serving, starts analytics, notification/listener, UI invalidation, and job-worker services, and stops those services before closing HTTP and database resources; several optional startup services log failure and let the app continue with degraded freshness or performance.",
